config DRM_FXG
	tristate "FXG-1 GPU (Rust DRM render driver)"
	depends on DRM=y
	depends on PCI
	depends on RUST
	depends on HAS_DMA
	default n
	help
	  Rust DRM render driver for the FXG-1 GPU, a small PCIe GPU with
	  programmable vertex and fragment shaders.

	  If M is selected, the module will be called fxg.
